{"last_link_id": 10, "nodes": [{"outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "MASK", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "MASK"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["7270a29605d4b702cd1d5d53907a1828af65e305e7828baab97418993c158f56.png", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "choose file to upload"}], "flags": {}, "type": "LoadImage", "title": "Load Image（API 价格表）", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [998.6764526367188, 1483.57861328125], "pos": [-1361.318115234375, -328.8528747558594], "id": 14, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage", "ttNbgOverride": {"bgcolor": "#533", "groupcolor": "#A88", "color": "#322"}}, "order": 0}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#fff0", "inputs": [], "flags": {"allow_interaction": true}, "type": "Label (rgthree)", "title": "行业标杆级AI 视频高清放大与画质增强工具", "mode": 4, "bgcolor": "#fff0", "size": [730.4609375, 38], "pos": [313.0189208984375, -521.8306884765625], "id": 18, "properties": {"padding": 0, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fontFamily": "Arial", "borderRadius": 0, "textAlign": "left", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "fontSize": 38, "fontColor": "#ffffff"}, "order": 1}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["### Topaz Video AI（原 Video Enhance AI）简介\nTopaz Video AI 是美国 Topaz Labs 公司推出的**AI 视频超分与修复软件**，主打“**模糊视频变高清、低分辨率放大到 4K/8K**”，广泛用于老片修复、监控取证、自媒体与影视后期。\n\n\n#### 一、核心原理\n- **非插值，而是 AI 重建**：不靠传统拉伸像素，而是用**深度学习模型**（基于海量高清/低清视频训练）“脑补”真实细节。\n- **帧间时序分析**：结合相邻帧运动轨迹与光流估计，放大后**无闪烁、无拖影、边缘锐利**。\n- **离线本地运算**：无需上传云端，**隐私安全、速度更快**。\n#### 二、核心功能（高清放大为主）\n1. **AI 无损放大（超分辨率）**\n    - 支持 **2x–16x** 放大：360p/480p → 720p/1080p → 4K → **8K**。\n    - 内置多模型：**Proteus（通用）、Artemis（动画）、Starlight（细节）、Gaia（老胶片）** 等，自动适配画面类型。\n2. **画质修复一体化**\n    - 降噪、去压缩块、去模糊、去隔行，**老视频/监控/低码率素材**效果显著。\n3. **帧率提升（插帧）**\n    - 24fps → 60/120fps，**慢动作更丝滑、运动更流畅**。\n4. **批量处理与 GPU 加速**\n    - 一次处理多个视频，支持 **NVIDIA/AMD 显卡加速**，大幅缩短渲染时间。\n#### 三、典型应用场景\n- **老电影/旧录像修复**：标清转 4K，去划痕、去噪点。\n- **监控/取证增强**：放大车牌、人脸，保留细节。\n- **自媒体/短视频优化**：提升手机/网络视频清晰度。\n- **动画/游戏录屏放大**：线条更干净、细节更锐利。\n#### 四、优缺点\n- **优点**：放大效果行业顶尖、模型丰富、本地运行安全、支持 8K 输出。\n- **缺点**：**付费软件**、对硬件要求较高（建议 RTX 3060+、32GB 内存）、高分辨率渲染耗时。\n#### 五、版本与界面\n- 最新版：**Video AI 7.x**（2026），原名 Video Enhance AI。\n- 界面简洁：导入视频 → 选模型 → 调参数 → 预览 → 输出，**新手易上手**。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "Topaz Video AI", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [617.0328979492188, 821.1663208007812], "pos": [-2057.598388671875, -320.0777282714844], "id": 17, "properties": {}, "order": 2}, {"outputs": [{"name": "VIDEO", "links": [2], "label": "VIDEO", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "VIDEO"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["3bacdeee31b38d7239471b8e447229b4cda3a4aa3c4d30add4286ad7f530d172.mp4", true, "0", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "file"}, "name": "file", "label": "file", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "file"}, {"widget": {"name": "keep_audio"}, "name": "keep_audio", "label": "keep_audio", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "keep_audio"}, {"widget": {"name": "trim_time"}, "name": "trim_time", "label": "trim_time", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "trim_time"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "choose file to upload"}], "flags": {}, "type": "LoadVideo", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [515.783203125, 1038.9478759765625], "pos": [-88.55123901367188, -226.55906677246094], "id": 6, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadVideo", "ttNbgOverride": {"bgcolor": "#533", "groupcolor": "#A88", "color": "#322"}}, "order": 3}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#fff0", "inputs": [], "flags": {"allow_interaction": true}, "type": "Label (rgthree)", "title": "TopazLabs 视频高清放